WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:22.252
"There's going to be a carriage race!" Tom said.

2
00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:25.121
"Kings will come from other kingdoms.

3
00:00:25.122 --> 00:00:28.873
They will see whose royal carriage is fastest.

4
00:00:28.874 --> 00:00:31.384
It will be so exciting!"

5
00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:33.784
Cat licked a paw.

6
00:00:33.785 --> 00:00:37.341
"It sounds like a royal mess," she said.

7
00:00:37.342 --> 00:00:41.425
"One king will win. The others will lose.

8
00:00:41.426 --> 00:00:44.897
And kings do not like losing!"

9
00:00:44.898 --> 00:00:49.552
"The royal wizards will put spells on the carriages," said Tom.

10
00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:53.345
"The best spell will win the race.

11
00:00:53.346 --> 00:00:57.114
I need a good spell for the king's carriage."

12
00:00:57.115 --> 00:01:02.112
Tom thought and thought.

13
00:01:02.113 --> 00:01:07.364
He checked his spell books.

14
00:01:07.365 --> 00:01:11.469
Finally Tom went to the royal stables.

15
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.648
He lifted his wand.

16
00:01:13.649 --> 00:01:15.947
"Horses, run fast!

17
00:01:15.948 --> 00:01:19.163
Carriage, do not be last!"

18
00:01:19.164 --> 00:01:23.665
Poof! Wings appeared on the carriage wheels.

19
00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:26.768
The horses sparkled with magic.

20
00:01:26.769 --> 00:01:33.519
Tom smiled. "I hope this works!"

21
00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:40.702
Soon the other kings and wizards arrived.

22
00:01:40.703 --> 00:01:44.410
One wizard waved at Tom.

23
00:01:44.411 --> 00:01:45.943
It was May.

24
00:01:45.944 --> 00:01:48.967
Tom knew her from wizard school.

25
00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:52.627
Another wizard was laughing.

26
00:01:52.628 --> 00:01:54.810
It was Walter.

27
00:01:54.811 --> 00:01:58.799
"I know which king will lose this race!" Walter said.

28
00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.380
"Tom can't even put a spell on an apple cart.

29
00:02:02.381 --> 00:02:06.361
His carriage will be as slow as a snail!"

30
00:02:06.362 --> 00:02:08.067
Tom frowned.

31
00:02:08.068 --> 00:02:10.382
"Just wait, Walter!" he said.

32
00:02:10.383 --> 00:02:12.475
"My king will win!"

33
00:02:12.476 --> 00:02:22.706
"Ha-ha!" said Walter. "We'll see about that!"
